# Your hub and sites: one line each, four columns.
#   name      a short name you choose; a site's is its ACM ManagedCluster name
#   role      hub, or the site's role: combined, ingress or inference
#   location  where the site is, such as us-east (the console shows it); - for the hub
#   api       the cluster's API URL
# Each cluster's login is .config/NAME/kubeconfig, which git ignores: make login NAME=...
#
# name                role       location            api
hub                   hub        -                   REQUIRED-hubAPIURL
REQUIRED-siteName     combined   REQUIRED-location   REQUIRED-siteAPIURL
